{
  "name": "sketchnote",
  "label": "Sketchnote",
  "offered": false,
  "description": "A page of notes filling by hand: a felt pen that wobbles a little on a dotted notebook page, shapes scribbled in, chunky marker titles over neat handwriting, a blue pen for what matters and yellow highlighter behind key words, words written on as they are said and the page wiped to the next. Suits summaries, lectures, books, study notes, plans and anything a person would sketch to remember.",
